    "LIMIT order, offset 1 tick, TTL 5 bars. YES bar price 0.40 at m0-m5; signal at m0, limit 0.41, live m1..m5.",
    "Every bar m1..m5 prints only BUY 100 @ 0.45 (above the limit): NO_PRINTS_AT_LIMIT at m1..m4 (the order rests), and at m5 the TTL lapses.",
    "The trade row is UNEXECUTABLE_LIMIT_EXPIRED / LIMIT_EXPIRED dated m5 with best_price_seen 0.45 and bars_waited 5. No price is invented: entry_price is null. Cash stays 100."
  ],
